---

This project drives the Spine editor's command-line tool as a separate process.
It does not contain, distribute, or sublicense any part of Spine. Spine is
commercial software from Esoteric Software, and every user runs their own
installation under their own licence — the SPINE_BIN environment variable
points at it. Nothing here grants a Spine licence to anybody, and one person's
licence never reaches another.

The tools that need the Spine CLI (pack_atlas, make_project, export_project,
project_info) simply report it as unavailable when it is not installed. Rigging
and animating do not use it at all.
